# k.scenes/shards/scenes-indoors: 17 scenes indoors (kitchen, bedroom, living room, bathroom, classroom, office, supermarket, restaurant, library, hospital, workshop, theatre, museum, cafe, nursery, laboratory, birthday party): what is usually there, how many, where in the picture, what happens there, the time, weather and season that fit; and other names of the scenes.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: tools/scenes-data.mjs)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/scenes-core.mjs

